			"updated": 1786542031671,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "We use a combination of both Horizontal Scaling and Vertical Scaling \nFeatures from Vertical Scaling: \n-> Data Consistency\n-> Inter Process Communication\n\nFeature from Horizontal Scaling:\n-> No Single Point of failure\n-> Scales well\n ",
			"rawText": "We use a combination of both Horizontal Scaling and Vertical Scaling \nFeatures from Vertical Scaling: \n-> Data Consistency\n-> Inter Process Communication\n\nFeature from Horizontal Scaling:\n-> No Single Point of failure\n-> Scales well\n ",
